  "limitations": [
    "Single complete sweep on one WSL2 host; frequency, thermal state and host scheduling uncontrolled.",
    "C then mzstd run consecutively per case in a fixed order. Individual mean confidence intervals do not account for all host variation or multiple comparisons.",
    "Every corpus/level pair has equal weight, including empty and tiny input. A median near 1 does not imply parity on large text or a statistically established overall lead.",
    "Cold APIs include allocation and allocator state; warm reuse, streaming and parallel compression are outside this matrix.",
    "The C library is built by zstd-ffi with cc defaults and without its Huffman assembly decoder.",
    "The 2026-10-13 and 2026-10-14 sweeps used different sampling durations and concurrent workloads. Their aggregate difference is not a controlled before/after speedup."
  ]
